# S5-07 identical-input direct replay control

Date: 2026-11-16

## Purpose and scope

Two separate direct single runs replay the same current guest input, including the same nonce, to measure within-pair repeatability. This is diagnostic evidence only; duplicate nonce runs do not satisfy the unique-nonce requirement for an S5-07 acceptance series. The prior 2026-11-15 RDTSC N=2 pair used an older ACPI blob, so this replay does not hold every artifact fixed relative to that pair.

## Provenance

- Host: Darwin arm64.
- Runner: `target/release/od-runner`; SHA-256: `90c5db937de8fff1501c1ce24f0b3a35a546b557dbe24c5a73bd24be6d6b343f`.
- The runner binary was built after commit `886f7fa57164ac82ebb198abb08bb05a72d4ab57` (`runner: mark norandmaps runs diagnostic`); runner source/dependency trees `crates/`, `apps/` and `tools/runner/` have no changes from that commit through the current HEAD. The direct-run schema is v1 and does not embed the runner source revision, so the executable hash is retained as the run identity.
- Kernel SHA-256: `9f55ef7253055a9cf68f8a04323c93dead2fca617386d842fbde9ca7b178b27e`.
- Initramfs SHA-256: `ee9183a4eded3c16a8c6a7a81c6d5bb79be8bb023f793f7cd61694ea2bd3e588`.
- ACPI blob SHA-256: `6fc25b091348d8ad314bdd0f4f579ec9dd3969c961020a7a61d2daeb8dc26d4d` (1104 bytes, includes `\_SB.CPU0`); manifest hash: `2bd690ae0817705b1b128675f9628dd7212fee74ab97c88da3599a1ae8e398f2`. The prior RDTSC N=2 evidence used ACPI blob SHA-256 `b1ba6078a4d9bc7a8d224980713d8242e4a708743ce4f56093b00a07c631ffaf` with the same manifest hash.
- Guest nonce: `OD5IDENT20261116aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa`; cmdline: `console=ttyS0,115200 earlycon=uart8250,io,0x3f8 8250.nr_uarts=1 od.nonce=OD5IDENT20261116aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa nokaslr`.
- Board profile: 128 MiB, `stage4a`, `--user-mode`, no `--linux-norandmaps`; retirement budget: `3,000,000,000`.

## Commands

Run A and Run B used identical arguments except for the host output and sidecar paths:

```sh
target/release/od-runner linux-direct \
  --nonce OD5IDENT20261116aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa \
  --expected-vmlinuz-sha256 9f55ef7253055a9cf68f8a04323c93dead2fca617386d842fbde9ca7b178b27e \
  --expected-initramfs-sha256 ee9183a4eded3c16a8c6a7a81c6d5bb79be8bb023f793f7cd61694ea2bd3e588 \
  --expected-acpi-manifest-hash 2bd690ae0817705b1b128675f9628dd7212fee74ab97c88da3599a1ae8e398f2 \
  --vmlinuz /Users/senya/projects/open_desktop/work/stage4/linux-7.0.0-38.38/vmlinuz-7.0.0-38-generic \
  --initramfs /Users/senya/projects/open_desktop/work/stage4/initramfs/initramfs.cpio \
  --acpi-blob tests/fixtures/guest/stage4/acpi_blob/stage4_acpi_blob.bin \
  --ram-mib 128 --out <run-output.json> \
  --run --budget 3000000000 --set-cpl0 --cpuid-profile stage4a --user-mode \
  --execution-observations-out <run-sidecar.json>
```

