## Conclusion

The current guest input produced an identical UART transcript, stop record, machine observations and execution-observation sidecar in this pair. The previous RDTSC N=2 pair used the older ACPI blob, so this does not show that earlier variation disappears with the same artifact set or isolate nonce as a cause. It establishes only exact repeatability for one same-nonce pair on the current fixture; internal guest randomness or other run state was not independently controlled. No comparator normalization changed. S5-07 remains blocked until a unique-nonce automatic N=2 acceptance series is strict-clean and the remaining earlier differences are explained.

Raw direct-run JSON and sidecars are retained locally under `work/stage5/stage5-s5-07-identical-input-20261116-a/`; those files are ignored build/run evidence, not committed.
